{"step_index":155,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-16T08:42:25Z","input_tokens":2931,"cache_read_tokens":166712,"output_tokens":8644,"thinking":"The goal is to revise the logic to allow a single waiting slot that can hold multiple cards of the same color, and a column clears when all cards of its color are sorted. This requires modifying how the waiting slot and column clearing mechanisms work. The current implementation is single-card based, so I will need to track multiple cards within a single slot and verify completion across all columns for a specific color.\n\n\nThe new logic introduces a unified color buffer slot that accepts multiple cards of the same color, allowing cards to accumulate. Clicking the slot will move all cards of the same color either to a column with matching bottom cards or an empty one. A column is cleared when all cards of its specific color are sorted into that column, needing to check for color completion against the total card counts.\n\n\nColumn clearing now requires that the number of cards in the column equals the total count for that color, ensuring 100% completion before the column clears and becomes empty. This logic applies universally, from the 8x20 Mushroom map to custom levels. Progress tracking per-color could be shown, such as \"[Color: current / total]\", which indicates how close a color is to being completed. Consider also providing varied levels.\n\n\nThe UI for the slot will be a single, centered element at the bottom, dynamically displaying cards and counts or a descriptive message when empty. Clicking the slot initiates a push operation of all held cards of that color to a compatible or empty column; clicking a column transfers bottom cards to the slot, subject to color compatibility. The column clear rule is now explicitly linked to a pure-color condition, where the column's count matches the total card count for that color, triggering the clear animation and completion tracking. The new version will be saved to a new file and tested thoroughly. The target column function needs to prioritize existing matching columns, then empty columns, and finally the slot.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"New version of Card Sort (v2) with a Single Multi-Card Same-Color Holding Slot, color completion progress trackers, and columns clearing only when 100% of a color's cards are collected into a single pure column.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","Content":"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"vi\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\\\">\\n  <title>Card Sort v2: Single Color Buffer Slot & Full-Color Clear</title>\\n  <style>\\n    * {\\n      box-sizing: border-box;\\n      margin: 0;\\n      padding: 0;\\n      user-select: none;\\n      -webkit-user-select: none;\\n    }\\n    body {\\n      background: #06170d;\\n      color: #ffffff;\\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, sans-serif;\\n      display: flex;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      min-height: 100vh;\\n      padding: 10px;\\n    }\\n    #game-container {\\n      position: relative;\\n      width: 700px;\\n      max-width: 100%;\\n      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, #176537 0%, #114b29 70%, #0a331c 100%);\\n      border: 4px solid #082313;\\n      border-radius: 24px;\\n      padding: 14px 16px;\\n      box-shadow: inset 0 0 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 20px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      min-height: 740px;\\n      transition: border-color 0.3s;\\n    }\\n    /* Header HUD */\\n    .header-bar {\\n      display: flex;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      padding-bottom: 10px;\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\\n    }\\n    .title-box h1 {\\n      font-size: 16px;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      color: #fef08a;\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 6px;\\n    }\\n    .title-box p {\\n      font-size: 11px;\\n      color: #86efac;\\n      margin-top: 2px;\\n    }\\n    .btn-group {\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 8px;\\n    }\\n    .hud-badge {\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      font-weight: 700;\\n      color: #fef9c3;\\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\\n      padding: 5px 12px;\\n      border-radius: 12px;\\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\\n    }\\n    .ct\n<truncated 18580 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Admin\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\0ca39d47-bf1d-4d04-97dc-9c2fe64cb8c8\\\\pixel_art_card_sort_v2.html\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
