{"step_index":161,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-16T08:51:12Z","input_tokens":4000,"cache_read_tokens":226345,"output_tokens":5750,"thinking":"I'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\nThe design focuses on a mobile-first, vertical layout. It will use a 6-column structure, each sized for comfortable thumb interaction, preventing accidental mis-taps. Cards within each column will overlap, creating a pixel art effect, with the bottom card in each column featuring a larger, easily readable badge displaying a count (e.g., \"5 / 8\"). A dedicated, larger waiting slot will appear below, also with a badge.\n\n\nThe mobile interface adopts a vertical orientation with a 6-column structure optimized for thumb interaction. A high-resolution pixel art canvas (10x12 or 8x12 grid) at the top will depict a Mario mushroom, with rows dynamically \"falling\" into five wide, vertically arranged columns below. Each of these columns will display overlapping cards with clear, large badges on the bottom card, indicating counts. A dedicated waiting slot at the bottom will also feature a badge to show the number of waiting cards.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"import os\\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw, ImageFont\\n\\nfont_title = ImageFont.truetype('C:/Windows/Fonts/segoeuib.ttf', 18)\\nfont_sub = ImageFont.truetype('C:/Windows/Fonts/segoeui.ttf', 12)\\nfont_card_num = ImageFont.truetype('C:/Windows/Fonts/segoeuib.ttf', 15)\\nfont_badge = ImageFont.truetype('C:/Windows/Fonts/segoeuib.ttf', 11)\\nfont_sm = ImageFont.truetype('C:/Windows/Fonts/segoeui.ttf', 11)\\n\\nPALETTE = {\\n    'B': {'fill': (15, 23, 42),    'border': (51, 65, 85),    'text': '#ffffff', 'name': 'Xanh Đêm'},\\n    'R': {'fill': (239, 68, 68),   'border': (185, 28, 28),   'text': '#ffffff', 'name': 'Đỏ'},\\n    'W': {'fill': (248, 250, 252), 'border': (148, 163, 184), 'text': '#0f172a', 'name': 'Trắng'},\\n    'S': {'fill': (254, 215, 170), 'border': (217, 119, 6),   'text': '#7c2d12', 'name': 'Da'},\\n    'D': {'fill': (24, 24, 27),    'border': (82, 82, 91),    'text': '#ffffff', 'name': 'Đen'},\\n    'G': {'fill': (34, 197, 94),   'border': (21, 128, 61),   'text': '#052e16', 'name': 'Xanh Lá'},\\n    'Y': {'fill': (234, 179, 8),   'border': (161, 98, 7),    'text': '#422006', 'name': 'Vàng'}\\n}\\n\\n# ==============================================================================\\n# CÁCH 1: 6 CỘT RỘNG RÃI (58px) + NÉN PIXEL 14px + LÁ ĐÁY TÁCH NHẸ GHI SỐ (k/8)\\n# ==============================================================================\\ndef render_cach_1(out_path):\\n    W, H = 440, 780\\n    img = Image.new('RGB', (W, H), '#06170d')\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n\\n    # Mobile Frame\\n    d.rounded_rectangle([10, 10, W - 10, H - 10], radius=32, fill='#114b29', outline='#082614', width=5)\\n    d.rounded_rectangle([16, 16, W - 16, H - 16], radius=28, fill='#145a32', outline='#0d3d22', width=2)\\n\\n    # Header\\n    d.text((28, 26), \\\"CÁCH 1: 6 CỘT LỚN + LÁ ĐÁY GHI SỐ\\\", fill='#fef08a', font=font_title)\\n    d.text((28, 50), \\\"Cột rộng 58px dễ bấm · Thân trên nén 14px làm Pixel · Đáy hiện k/Target\\\", fill='#86efac', font=font_sub)\\n\\n    # 6x16 Pixel Art (Cute \n<truncated 10263 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Admin\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\0ca39d47-bf1d-4d04-97dc-9c2fe64cb8c8\\\\generate_both_demos.py\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
